+    <main>
+      <h1>Runtime model router UI</h1>
+      <p>
+        This PR is the Canvas companion for the software-agent-sdk model-router work. It adds an optional conversation-header control that appears only when the runtime supports the new model-router status endpoint. The control lets testers add existing LLM profiles as routes and manually switch routes without waiting for a released <code>@openhands/typescript-client</code> package.
